    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a kind of woollen fabric (a worsted, among other things) formerly used for articles of attire, especially in the 16th century (OED s.v. russel²); of obscure origin, possibly from Rijssel, the Flemish name of Lille</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
